SUMMARY:DEF CON Group Chicago
DESCRIPTION:We'll be at the <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/s9BvHjHzaQwGrprc9" target="_blank"><u><u>Sulzer Regional Library</u></u></a> again on <b>7/7/26 from 6-7:30pm </b>in the small meeting room to the right as you enter the lobby. <br><br>The area around the library has several spots to grab food after the meeting including Small Cheval\, Lou Malnatis\, Jimmy's Pizza Cafe\, Taqueria El Asadero\, and several other solid spots.The area is accessible via:<ul><li>CTA Brown Train Line - Western station</li><li>No. 49 Western Ave. &amp\; 49B North Western Ave</li><li>No. 50 Damen Ave.</li><li>No. 78 Montrose</li><li>No. 81 Lawrence (connects to red line near Broadway)</li></ul>Parking: The library has a free parking lot behind the library\, enter on Sunnyside Ave. There is also free street parking on some of the side streets (please read signs) and city lots are just north on Lincoln as well.<br><br><b>Learn More:</b> <a href="https://dcgchicago.org/dcg312/meetings/2025/10/15/nov-2025-meeting.html" target="_blank"><u><u><u>https://dcgchicago.org/</u></u></u></a><br><br><b>What is a DEF CON Group: </b><a href="https://forum.defcon.org/node/231249" target="_blank"><u><u><u>https://forum.defcon.org/node/231249</u></u></u></a> | Source: Chicago InfoSec Events Calendar | Tags: infosec\, security | https://maps.app.goo.gl/s9BvHjHzaQwGrprc9"
LOCATION:
URL:https://maps.app.goo.gl/s9BvHjHzaQwGrprc9"
